  <name>OpenCreative</name>
  <summary>Customize DeepCool LCD cooler screens</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Open-source control for DeepCool's LCD coolers, an alternative to the
      Windows-only DeepCreative app. Show live CPU, GPU, memory and power
      readings in a choice of skins, or your own images and GIFs, and see
      your computer's readings on a dashboard.
    </p>
    <p>Not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepCool.</p>
  </description>
